.SH YOCTO INTEGRATION
.B ws2socket
is designed for Yocto Project:
.IP \(bu 2
CMake build system (Yocto native)
.IP \(bu 2
No Python dependencies
.IP \(bu 2
LGPL v3 license (Yocto-compatible)
.IP \(bu 2
Minimal footprint for embedded targets
.IP \(bu 2
Compatible with Yocto Scarthgap 5+

See IMPLEMENTATION.md for BitBake recipe example.

.SH NOVNC INTEGRATION
To use with noVNC:
.IP 1. 3
Install noVNC: git clone https://github.com/novnc/noVNC.git /usr/share/novnc
.IP 2. 3
Start VNC server: Xvnc :1 \-geometry 1280x720
.IP 3. 3
Start ws2socket: ws2socket \-\-web-root /usr/share/novnc \-\-target 127.0.0.1:5901
.IP 4. 3
Access in browser: http://localhost:6080/vnc.html

See NOVNC_GUIDE.md for complete integration guide.

